WEBVTT

00:00:29.473 --> 00:00:31.029
(Laughter)

00:00:31.053 --> 00:00:33.086
OK, so that's everyone, I think.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:34.260
(Laughter)

00:00:34.752 --> 00:00:36.752
So why do you do these things?

00:00:37.165 --> 00:00:38.316
My guess is,

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.728
it's because you care about your privacy.

00:00:40.752 --> 00:00:43.751
The idea that privacy is dead is a myth.

00:00:43.775 --> 00:00:46.513
The idea that people
don't care about their privacy

00:00:46.537 --> 00:00:48.237
because "they have nothing to hide"

00:00:48.261 --> 00:00:49.903
or they've done nothing wrong

00:00:49.927 --> 00:00:51.170
is also a myth.

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:56.496
I'm guessing that you would not want
to publicly share on the internet,

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.932
for the world to see,

00:00:57.956 --> 00:00:59.758
all of your medical records.

00:00:59.782 --> 00:01:03.218
Or your search histories
from your phone or your computer.